    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with osteoarthritis of the knees at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together.",
