      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like osteoarthritis of the knees, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in both knees for six months, moderate, and no locking of the knee or pain in other joints.",
