    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'm going to order an X-ray of both knees, for knee pain. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'd like you to take etoricoxib, 60 milligrams, once a day, for five days. You take it by mouth. It's for knee pain. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up.",
