    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Losing even a few kilos takes a lot of load off the knees, and I'd like you to do the strengthening exercises. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. I'd like you to see physiotherapy as well, and I'll write the referral. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently.",
